        "title": "Inhibitory effect of caffeic acid on human organic anion transporters hOAT1 and hOAT3: a novel candidate for food-drug interaction.",
        "authorString": "Uwai Y, Ozeki Y, Isaka T, Honjo H, Iwamoto K.",
